# AI code CLI assistants — the landscape (2025–2026)
#
# tools that operate in the terminal, read your codebase, edit files,
# run commands, and handle multi-step coding tasks autonomously.
# distinct from IDE plugins (Copilot in VS Code) or chat UIs (Claude.ai).


# --- major lab CLIs (full agentic) ---

# Claude Code (Anthropic)
# - the benchmark for agentic CLI coding assistants
# - full codebase context, file editing, shell execution, multi-step tasks
# - powered by Claude (Sonnet / Opus)
# - https://claude.ai/code

# Codex CLI (OpenAI)
# - released April 2025; similar agentic approach to Claude Code
# - powered by o3 / o4-mini
